SUMMARY:Information: LIONESS LINE: Saturday 17 and Sunday 18 October\, a 
 reduced service will run between Kilburn High Road and Euston. On 
 Saturday\, between 0630 and 2030\, trains departing Watford Junction at 30
  minutes past each hour will terminate at Kilburn High Road. From 0715 
 until 2115\, trains departing Euston at 15 minutes past each hour will 
 start from Kilburn High Road. On Sunday\, between 1130 and 2030\,  trains 
 departing Watford Junction at 30 minutes past each hour will terminate at 
 Kilburn High Road. From 1215 until 2115\, trains departing Euston at 15 
 minutes past each hour will start from Kilburn High Road
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR